{"ticker":"PCAR","updated":"2026-10-23T23:26:34Z","profile":{"longName":"PACCAR Inc","shortName":"PACCAR Inc.","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Farm & Heavy Construction Machinery","country":"United States","website":"https://www.paccar.com","fullTimeEmployees":25900,"marketCap":56299995136,"trailingPE":22.517895,"forwardPE":14.93932,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":2.0240293,"pegRatio":0.77,"targetMeanPrice":133.375,"targetHighPrice":162.0,"targetLowPrice":107.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":16,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.005,"earningsGrowth":0.042,"grossMargins":0.13715,"operatingMargins":0.12024,"profitMargins":0.09003,"totalRevenue":27815800832,"beta":0.988,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":139.24,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":93.86,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.28},"summary":"PACCAR Inc designs, manufactures, and distributes light, medium, and heavy-duty commercial trucks in the United States, Canada, Australia, Mexico, Europe, Central and South America, and internationally. It operates through three segments: Truck, Parts, and Financial Services. The Truck segment designs, manufactures, and distributes trucks for the over-the-road and off-highway hauling of commercial and consumer goods; and diesel engine products. It sells its trucks through a network of independent dealers under the Kenworth, Peterbilt, and DAF nameplates. The Parts segment distributes aftermarket parts for trucks and related commercial vehicles. The Financial Services segment conducts full-service leasing operations under the PacLease trade name, as well as provides finance and leasing products and services to customers and dealers. This segment offers equipment financing and administrative support services for its franchisees; retail loan and leasing services for small, medium, and large commercial trucking companies, as well as independent owners/operators and other businesses; and truck inventory financing services to independent dealers. In addition, this segment offers loans and leases directly to customers for the acquisition of trucks and related equipment; and operates its own full-service lease outlets. The company manufactures and markets industrial winches under the B","summary_zh":"PACCAR Inc 在美國、加拿大、澳洲、墨西哥、歐洲、中美洲和南美洲以及國際上設計、製造和分銷輕型、中型和重型商用卡車。它透過三個部門運作：卡車部門、零件部門和金融服務部門。卡車部門設計、製造和分銷用於商業和消費品的公路和非公路運輸的卡車；和柴油引擎產品。該公司透過獨立經銷商網路以 Kenworth、Peterbilt 和 DAF 品牌銷售卡車。零件部門分銷卡車和相關商用車的售後零件。金融服務部門以 PacLease 商標名稱進行全方位服務租賃業務，並向客戶和經銷商提供融資和租賃產品及服務。該部門為其特許經營商提供設備融資和行政支援服務；為小型、中型和大型商業貨運公司以及獨立所有者/經營者和其他企業提供零售貸款和租賃服務；以及為獨立經銷商提供卡車庫存融資服務。此外，該部門直接向客戶提供貸款和租賃，以購買卡車和相關設備；並經營自己的全方位服務租賃據點。該公司生產和銷售 B 級工業絞車","sector_zh":"工業","industry_zh":"農業和重型工程機械","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":100.36,"h":101.3,"l":99.49,"c":100.51,"v":2335500},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":100.03,"h":100.63,"l":99.73,"c":100.25,"v":2420800},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":99.42,"h":101.57,"l":98.62,"c":101.44,"v":1981800},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":101.57,"h":101.82,"l":100.46,"c":100.68,"v":1863700},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":99.82,"h":101.37,"l":99.53,"c":99.98,"v":2225800},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":99.33,"h":99.33,"l":97.85,"c":98.86,"v":2691700},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":98.86,"h":99.36,"l":95.82,"c":96.22,"v":2131400},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":96.54,"h":98.26,"l":95.81,"c":98.21,"v":1946100},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":98.43,"h":100.12,"l":98.05,"c":99.05,"v":2084000},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":99.24,"h":99.24,"l":97.23,"c":98.25,"v":1742500},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":98.2,"h":98.64,"l":97.23,"c":97.53,"v":1703500},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":97.15,"h":98.81,"l":97.0,"c":98.66,"v":2075500},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":98.6,"h":102.11,"l":98.59,"c":101.76,"v":2671400},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":101.5,"h":103.48,"l":100.57,"c":102.51,"v":3812100},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":102.53,"h":102.87,"l":101.02,"c":102.17,"v":3092400},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":102.18,"h":103.22,"l":101.84,"c":102.86,"v":2240200},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":103.17,"h":103.85,"l":100.26,"c":100.86,"v":3991100},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":100.48,"h":101.97,"l":99.5,"c":101.42,"v":3394700},{"t